<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11802] Check keepSerializedObjects() condition after each test</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11802</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;After some changes in GridAbstractTest class &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; condition on &lt;tt&gt;serializedObj.clear()&lt;/tt&gt; invocation was removed &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;br/&gt;
 In the previous master version &lt;tt&gt;serializedObj.clear()&lt;/tt&gt; will be invoked only if &lt;tt&gt;!keepSerializedObjects()&lt;/tt&gt; condition will be satisfied.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Due to this reason, some tests became failed &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;3&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;, so it is necessary to return such check.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11412&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11412&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/6267/files#diff7a554fa780cd51aae79479d6e9dfcc96L2152&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/6267/files#diff7a554fa780cd51aae79479d6e9dfcc96L2152&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;3&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/MTCGA-new-failures-in-builds-3681058-3680965-needs-to-be-handled-td41859.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;http://apache-ignite-developers.2346864.n4.nabble.com/MTCGA-new-failures-in-builds-3681058-3680965-needs-to-be-handled-td41859.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
